            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<h2 id=\"the-architecture-in-one-picture\">The architecture in one picture</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The agent loop is the thin part. Everything enforcement-shaped lives in the tools: <code>apply_review_decisions</code> is the only way to write a workbook, and <code>memory_store</code> is the only way a rule becomes active.</span></span>"
          }
        }
